  powerful telepath and mutant Emma Frost  would restore his memory and would  restore the memory of him to the other  heroes but not the general public but  the century returns as a hero and helps  the Avengers the Fantastic Four and the  x-men fight so that's a quick brief of  his backstory but the reason why century  appearing in the MCU is so important is  because of all the stories that he is  involved in he fights with the Avengers  of many many times not to mention the  Fantastic Four as well he was in the  Civil War battle between Captain America  and Tony Stark he was in the Mighty  Avengers and most importantly he was in  World War Hulk when the Hulk had  captured the most powerful superheroes  on the planet everybody called on  Century for help even the President of  the United States asked the century to  help the earth however the Century  initially refused because he believed  that he would lose control and him  himself would destroy the earth but when  he found out that the Hulk had created a  gladiator arena and was forcing mr.  fantastic and Ironman to fight each  other to the death he finally decided to  step in in  intense battle with the Hulk he would  finally revert back to his human form  Robert Reynolds as well as the Hulk  reverting back to Bruce Banner so again  the important thing here is all of his  connections he has a deep connection to  the Fantastic Four he has a really deep  connection with the Hulk because even  before his memory was erased a couple of  times he and the Hulk were best friends  he fights with the Avengers a lot but he  also fights with the Dark Avengers led  by Norman Osborn so the fact that Marvel  Studios is thinking about creating a  Disney plus show for the century means  that there could be a lot of really  exciting things on the way we already  know that Mark Ruffalo said that he  would like to continue playing the Hulk  and that he has met with Kevin Feige to  talk about possible ideas we know that  the Avengers are going to eventually  return and there's going to be a new  Avengers team and it seems like the Dark  Avengers are being set up in the MCU  and now since Marvel Studios is thinking  about bringing in the century it seems  like we could get everything not too  long from now but let me know what you  think about the century entering the MCU  in his very own Disney Plus show let me  know what you think in the comments down  below don't forget to like the video and  subscribe and notifications turned on so  you can enter my giveaway for a chance  to win an Xbox one or ps4 I'm picking a  winner at five hundred and fifty  thousand subscribers as always thank you  all so much for watching  woof woof
 

